{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-primark-colour-block-purse-2606-0311","content_id":"477a21e0-5ef0-46a9-996b-bd4384dd0e71","description":"Product Recall for Primark Colour Block Purse presenting a serious chemical risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e22e80dc-1e96-4c2d-b67c-830d16e7fb0b","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-30T11:00:19+01:00","id":"e22e80dc-1e96-4c2d-b67c-830d16e7fb0b","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-30T11:00:19+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4393b35b6406df58c14016/2606-0311-product-recall-primark-coin-purse.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Primark Colour Block Purse</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains excessive concentrations of phthalates.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been recalled from end users by Primark Ltd.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Clothing, textiles and fashion items - Wallets/Purses/ Travel Document Holders</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Primark Ltd </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>3103002 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>991169270</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Coin purse in shades of brown.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e22e80dc-1e96-4c2d-b67c-830d16e7fb0b\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4393b35b6406df58c14016/2606-0311-product-recall-primark-coin-purse.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains excessive concentrations of Dibutyl phthalate (DBP), Bis(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate (DEHP), and Short Chain Chlorinated Paraffins (SCCPs). Phthalates are harmful to health and may cause damage to the reproductive system.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the REACH Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Primark Ltd. </p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using the product immediately and keep it out of reach of children. Return the product to any Primark store for a full refund. For further information, please contact Primark via the live chat: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.primark.com/help/s/?language=en_GB\">Help Centre</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2606-0311</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-30T10:00:56Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"clothing-textiles-fashion","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-30","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-30T11:00:56+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-primark-colour-block-purs